<title>USA: Sphere Drake completes yachting unit sale.</title>
<headline>Sphere Drake completes yachting unit sale.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sphere Drake Holdings Ltd said on Thursday it completed the sale of its Groves, John &amp; Westrup (Underwriting) Ltd, its yacht and cargo underwriting agency based in Liverpool, England to a Lloyd's syndicate.</p>
<p>The 590/2591 syndicate is managed by Cox Insurance Holdings plc. Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Sphere Drake said the sale was part of its recently announced plan to concentrate on fewer lines of business. Sphere Drake, through its companies in London and Bermuda, provides traditional and alternative reinsurance and specialty insurance protection.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
